re relative to project root\n**Path errors:** Use `.agents/templates/my-file.md` format\n\n**Debug tips:**\n\n1. Validate JSON: `cat file.json | jq`\n2. Restart Codebuff to see errors\n3. Test with `--agent <agent-id>` to debug specific agents\n\n**Next:** [Create new agents](/docs/agents/creating-new-agents) or see [troubleshooting guide](/docs/agents#troubleshooting-agent-customization)\n"
